{"unit_id":"WsTe47__mylife#card-zh","repo":"WsTe47/mylife","commit":"67ba7183376fa3d35e9397a39bd249d77206a441","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"MyLife 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的本地优先个人状态档案与决策辅助插件。它通过注册一组 mylife 工具接入会话，可逐字保存原始输入、整理主题摘要、记录带出处的证据和维护有时效的个人档案。用户可以查询及追溯证据、检查信息是否过期，并围绕决策补齐空白、查看前后变化；证伪分析可调用 DeepSeek。适合希望把零散自述整理成可复查资料的人，数据默认保存在本地工作区，使用 LLM 功能需配置凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:39-57","src/tools/index.js:77-80","src/lib/store.js:148-210"]}
{"unit_id":"WsTe47__mylife#card-en","repo":"WsTe47/mylife","commit":"67ba7183376fa3d35e9397a39bd249d77206a441","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"MyLife is a local-first personal record and decision support plugin for DeepSeek Harness. Its tools save notes, organize digests, track sourced evidence, and check profile freshness. Users can query claims and fill decision gaps; defeater analysis can call DeepSeek. Files stay local.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:39-57","src/tools/index.js:77-80","src/lib/store.js:148-210"]}
